  "solution": "Số kết quả chọn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math> mẩu giấy từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>35</mn></semantics></math> mẩu giấy là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>35</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><ul><li>Số kết quả thuận lợi cho biến cố <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup></mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>35</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4275</mn><mn>11594</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>87</mn><mi>%</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Số kết quả thuận lợi cho biến cố <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>20</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>15</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>20</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>20</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>15</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>20</mn><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup></mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>35</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>207879</mn><mn>324632</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>04</mn><mi>%</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math>: ““ Có ít nhất một người được chọn là nữ”” ta có<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>C</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover></semantics></math>: ““ Không có nhân viên nữ nào được chọn”” và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>C</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>15</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>C</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>15</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>35</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>4177</mn><mn>4216</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>99</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>07</mn><mi>%</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul></li><li>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>L</mi></semantics></math>: ““ Chị Lan được chọn””. Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>L</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover></semantics></math>: ““ Chị Lan không được chọn””.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>L</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>34</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup></mrow></semantics></math>, do đó xác suất chị Lan được chọn là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>34</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>35</mn><mn>5</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
